'''Iron Ingot''' is a {{Common}} collection item. 

== Collection ==
Collecting iron ingots increases the player's iron ingot [[Collections|collection]], which grants useful items and perks upon collecting certain amounts of iron ingots.
{{/Collection UI}}
{{CollectionTable|Iron Ingot}}

== Obtaining ==
=== Natural generation ===
Iron Ingot can be found naturally in the form of {{Item|Iron Ore}} in {{zone|Gold Mine}}, {{zone|Gunpowder Mines}}, {{zone|Dwarven Mines}} and {{zone|Crystal Hollows}}.

